# Generator flags this committed build was made with.
# Regenerate:  python3 compiler/main.py lmprobe --self-test
#
# NOT --board de2-115, despite the leftover .qsf/.sdc in this directory: the
# committed RTL has the default Xilinx fsm_encoding pragma, not the Altera
# comment, so it was generated without a board. Those constraint files are
# leftovers from a board run that was reverted, and they fooled
# make_build_flags.py into inferring --board on its first pass -- which is
# exactly the kind of mistake this file exists to stop.
--self-test
